{"id":"vod_lz_778","vodId":"778","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"擅长捉弄人的高木同学","name_cn":"擅长捉弄人的高木同学","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全+OVA","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220323-1/08b1be0a06021914b4da6e637d7a9b06.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一所初中内，西片（梶裕贵 配音）是一名平凡得不能再平凡的高中男生，性格和成绩都毫无亮点，唯一的过人之处，大概就是脾气要比一般人好得多。高木同学（高桥李依 配音）就坐在西片的旁边，让西片感到困扰的是，个性活泼开朗的高木同学，似乎总喜欢捉弄自己，并且乐在其中。\r\n随着时间的推移，西片决定不再默默忍受高木的捉弄，他要进行反击，要让高木也尝一尝被捉弄后害羞的滋味。然而，西片的捉弄计划却往往以失败告终，无论是谁捉弄谁，最后羞红了脸的永远都是西片。青涩的校园之中，充满了欢笑与希望的日常日复一日的展开着。©豆瓣","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-08-04 10:06:09","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn3.com/20220322/2772_fe019b10/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn3.com/20220322/2773_9cfdffaf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn3.com/20220322/2774_846bf10e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn3.com/20220322/2776_9215c79c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn3.com/20220322/2775_61e329c6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn3.com/20220322/2777_8840da5c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn3.com/20220322/2779_de4b3043/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn3.com/20220322/2778_c1b2cff2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn3.com/20220322/2780_c488af21/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn3.com/20220322/2781_58307255/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn3.com/20220322/2782_1149e5cc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn3.com/20220322/2783_d2e0fc43/index.m3u8"},{"name":"OVA","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn3.com/20220322/2785_0addab87/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:44:54.270Z"}